  "segments": [
    {
      "t": "2012 春。种下后的第一波春花。幼苗和镇楼的成熟植株各方面都差别天壤。并且这个博主习惯把细小分枝清理干净。如果按照只剪花不修枝的方式养护的话，小苗阶段完全看不出成熟植株的生长方式。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/5bb7e5e4a55e3cc0aa32b5ff1375a98f.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/dafc9922e52d89b3df822788c9e03ffe.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_8043671594_002.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_8043671594_003.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "13年春。外层花瓣被雨水打烂。这时候主枝已经不会被开花枝压倒了。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/14627e23c6621fa6dff0e9aa0a7f8623.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/55401cd329f48f029aaa794fbc433ac2.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "15年春。趋近成熟，花朵质量明显提升。注意修剪痕迹的话，看得出博主修剪方式是清空细小分枝后轻剪主枝。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/fb4afacc33bb888ccd224a5ad1f5f374.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/82acfc0cf38eb1f38797d20d31feded6.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "17年春花残花"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/3b11e694f3f3970b111008ca9033480c.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a2fcaafcd7b52ad5739f585c08c7e79c.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "19年五月，白薇花期已过。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/8cddd271bebc37615a22cda6bb3bccb6.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/05debe4d0219dfcada72d027fafcce27.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "真 * 待到山花烂漫时，她在丛中笑"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/42eb087f6809611d334d7e9927b09358.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/52cf512133a647673aaeae5072e1e34a.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "19年11月初。挨在左右的两颗奥斯汀基本秃了，白薇还在开，并且叶片总体健康。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a1634003f81cb480993901d2a67344f2.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c5103ffbaf79bbc861a882156245a938.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "20年春。轻微白粉。这点很遗憾，成熟植株也逃不掉。不过不至于像有的品种一样光杆。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/765cbe8402df095db388a5e01687e4f4.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/3d2292fb9a642b7bf19dd77417098141.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "22年春。高度1.2米。如果不是两边的奥挡光线的话，肯定表现更好更丰满。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a1e987c21592dd1d01a29039daa71cb1.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_8043671594_000.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_8043671594_001.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "博主所在城市气候。和上海非常接近，降雨更多。"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a7b53e0439e0c831c5886fa62a2ebed8.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "17春花后期。被吞了重新发"
    }
